       "fixedCode": "gather_facts: true\ntasks:\n  - name: Show the OS\n    ansible.builtin.debug:\n      msg: \"{{ ansible_facts['os_family'] }}\"",
       "explanation": "Facts are only collected when gather_facts is true; with it off, ansible_facts is empty and the task fails on an undefined variable."
