       "buggyCode": "# webserver/meta/main.yml\ndependencies:\n  - role: database\n# database/meta/main.yml\ndependencies:\n  - role: webserver",
       "fixedCode": "# webserver/meta/main.yml\ndependencies:\n  - role: common\n# database/meta/main.yml\ndependencies:\n  - role: common",
       "explanation": "Circular dependencies cannot be ordered, so Ansible fails; both roles should depend on the shared common role instead of on each other."
