       "buggyCode": "- import_tasks: \"{{ task_file }}.yml\"",
       "fixedCode": "- include_tasks: \"{{ task_file }}.yml\"",
       "explanation": "import_tasks is resolved when the playbook is parsed, before variables are evaluated; include_tasks is resolved at run time, so it can use variables."
