       "buggyCode": "resource \"aws_instance\" \"web\" {\n  depends_on = [aws_vpc.main, aws_subnet.main, aws_security_group.main]\n}",
       "fixedCode": "resource \"aws_instance\" \"web\" {\n  subnet_id = aws_subnet.main.id\n}",
       "explanation": "Referencing the subnet id creates the dependency automatically and shows why it exists; depends_on hides the reason and is only for hidden dependencies."
