       "fixedCode": "RUN echo \"a\" > /a.txt && echo \"b\" > /b.txt && echo \"c\" > /c.txt",
       "explanation": "Each RUN is a layer, so three RUNs mean three layers and three cache entries; one RUN with && does the same work in one layer."
