       "buggyCode": "$ docker run --read-only myapp   # app writes to /tmp and crashes",
       "fixedCode": "$ docker run --read-only --tmpfs /tmp myapp",
       "explanation": "A read-only container cannot write anywhere, including /tmp; a tmpfs mount gives it a writable scratch area in memory."
