      "title": "Secrets, Not Environment Variables",
      "concept": "Secrets belong in a secrets manager or a mounted secret file, not in environment variables, because environment variables are visible in docker inspect and in the process list. A secret file mounted at /run/secrets is readable only inside the container and disappears with it.",
      "syntax": "docker run --secret db_password myapp\n# or: --mount type=secret",
